/video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/7c8999a1bfa6c32ad0e5ca5d76e6b5ae.avif?t=1762403333\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet our unique cast of kitty wizards, including Yuri, a cat with a warm personality and passion for justice, and Akane, the lively brawn of the bunch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the cat wizard that fits your playstyle, each with unique abilities, and build them up how you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/1852adaeecd0090001402a7421a7a840.poster.avif?t=1762403333\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/1852adaeecd0090001402a7421a7a840.webm?t=1762403333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/e9fc93d8c442f6ab8927ffd4e59fda6b.avif?t=1762403333\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u300a Yuri \u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/40645602c6f783583b2fecc31b01ae82.avif?t=1762403333\" width=1200 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Voiced by:</strong> Yui Ogura</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kitty wizard who lost all her might due to the Curse of the Red Moon. Her personality favors justice, so she can't pass by those in need. As she ventures out into the world, she meets a cast of cat companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u300a Akane \u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/5381a9040d644d8fd21185d5eb4dd663.avif?t=1762403333\" width=1200 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Voiced by:</strong> Kana Ueda</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A combat kitty whose specialty is a lively cat punch. She's never one to turn down a fight, bravely accepting any challenge. Due to her combative nature, she often gets in trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u300a Koro \u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/1df7f69da0e642504afa6bafb4f0d39e.avif?t=1762403333\" width=1200 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Voiced by:</strong> Marie Miyake</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A legendary cat wizard well-versed in ancient magic. Unlike her youthful appearance suggests, she's actually a sage who has lived countless years. She's careful and experienced but doesn't get along well with others due to her time alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u300a Shiro \u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/1dcc7028ecf2137f0f12d5aaa70fb487.avif?t=1762403333\" width=1200 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Voiced by:</strong> Sakura Chirin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young kitty chosen by the gods to become the savior of light. She's still rather inexperienced, but her genius abilities and strong sense of duty raise expectations for her. She does have a habit of using her light magic when surprised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u300a Chloe \u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/a23c757a2934d416a3fc9f17351fb3b9.avif?t=1762403333\" width=1200 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Voiced by:</strong> Nozomi Yamane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A witch cat who's lived alone in the forest for many years, cut off from the world. She prefers quiet time alone with her only family, her familiar Kiki. She sometimes slips up due to her unfamiliarity with the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u300a Leo \u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/extras/500847466df10ebb1312bcd7c161f37a.avif?t=1762403333\" width=1200 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Voiced by:</strong> Kenta Kiyosumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A genius exorcist cat whose hobby is reading ancient tomes. He wants to share the knowledge he's gained from the tomes, but the response isn't great. Astounding sense of responsibility aside, he gets rather frightened and isn't all that helpful to his party.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Regarding gameplay upload and streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any individual or company may stream or upload videos of this game as long as the copyright information and store URLs are included within the video description or the video itself. We would appreciate creators leaving out spoilers of the ending whenever possible.</p>","developers":["Minimum Studio Corp."],"dlc":[4038770],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890940/456d61f0833713ff0e96d9ddcc972c9951bfc0fe/header.jpg?t=1762403333","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Minimum Studio Corp. All rights reserved. Published by CFK.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+ or Vulkan-capable, Nvidia and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+ or Vulkan-capable, Nvidia and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support (Intel processors) Apple M1 or above (Apple silicon-based processors)<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<